            "title": "Don't bet against the Fed, Oracle's Larry Ellison: Fmr. Cisco CEO",
            "description": "<p>JC2 Ventures founder and CEO John Chambers, who was formerly the CEO of Cisco (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CSCO\">CSCO</a>), joins Opening Bid host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to talk about the ongoing artificial intelligence (AI) trade and share which Big Tech leaders and players he's watching, including Oracle's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) Larry Ellison, Microsoft's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>) Satya Nadella, and AMD's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>) Lisa Su.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
