            "title": "2 companies well-positioned in AI-era cybersecurity",
            "description": "<p>\"Platformization\" has been a key theme in cybersecurity, with companies like CrowdStrike (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWD\">CRWD</a>) and Palo Alto Networks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PANW\">PANW</a>) consolidating their offerings to provide customers with a comprehensive platform solution.</p>\n<p>Mattermost CEO Ian Tien explains that, while platformization provides simplification and security, it also poses risks \u2014 primarily, over-consolidation. Tien also shares two companies in the space he thinks are well-positioned to succeed.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
